==== Specification ====

  * 560/450/225 MHz (CPU/DDR/AHB)
  * 64/128 MB of RAM (DDR2)
  * 8/16 MB of FLASH (SPI NOR)
  * 2T2R 5 GHz (AR9344)
  * 2x 10/100 Mbps Ethernet (one port support POE)
  * 7x LED (1x RGB, 6 driven by GPIO)
  * UART (J23), USB (J102), LEDs header on PCB

